08/01/books/review/brandy-colbert-the-voting-booth.html', 'snippet': 'In Brandy Colbert’s “The Voting Booth,” a girl who’s been speaking out since age 7 helps a drummer make his voice heard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was an adult the first time I volunteered for a presidential campaign. It was in 2008 for Barack Obama. As naïve as it sounds, I felt I was helping America begin to fulfill its promise: to be a place where “all men are created equal.” Fast-forward to today, when America has never seemed farther away from keeping that promise. In a world with so much injustice, how do we maintain hope and a willingness to fight, without burning out, or simply giving in to the easier option of looking the other way?', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/books/review/09-BKS-YOON-KIDS/09-BKS_YOON_KIDS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/09/books/review/09-BKS-YOON-KIDS/09-BKS_YOON_KIDS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/books/review/09-BKS-YOON-KIDS/09-BKS_YOON_KIDS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/books/review/09-BKS-YOON-KIDS/09-BKS_YOON_KIDS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/books/review/09-BKS-YOON-KIDS/09-BKS_YOON_KIDS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard',