{'abstract': 'The Florida coast was spared severe damage on Sunday, but much of the Eastern Seaboard is threatened with flooding rains.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/02/us/tropical-storm-isaias-florida-carolina.html', 'snippet': 'The Florida coast was spared severe damage on Sunday, but much of the Eastern Seaboard is threatened with flooding rains.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA —\xa0Tropical Storm Isaias buffeted Florida’s eastern edge on Sunday with more heavy rainfall and powerful winds as it skirted the Atlantic Coast, leaving many people bracing for the threat of flash floods, storm surges and even tornadoes as the storm made its way north.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/02/us/02storm-1/merlin_175215639_9253d98f-4c76-4648-9f8c-8436a3490656-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/02/us/02storm-1/merlin_175215639_9253d98f-4c76-4648-9f8c-8436a3490656-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/02/us/02storm-1/merlin_175215639_9253d98f-4c76-4648-9f8c-8436a3490656-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/02/us/02storm-1/merlin_175215639_9253d98f-4c76-4648-9f8c-8436a3490656-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/02/us/02storm-1/02storm-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSta