se as well as H.I.V. and malaria.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/03/health/coronavirus-tuberculosis-aids-malaria.html', 'snippet': 'Tuberculosis kills 1.5 million people each year. Lockdowns and supply-chain disruptions threaten progress against the disease as well as H.I.V. and malaria.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It begins with a mild fever and malaise, followed by a painful cough and shortness of breath. The infection prospers in crowds, spreading to people in close reach. Containing an outbreak requires contact tracing, as well as isolation and treatment of the sick for weeks or months.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/04/science/00VIRUS-GLOBAL4/merlin_174091218_11f51e9c-944b-4062-b5fd-9a77638d983f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/04/science/00VIRUS-GLOBAL4/merlin_174091218_11f51e9c-944b-4062-b5fd-9a77638d983f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/04/science/00VIRUS-GLOBAL4/merlin_174091218_11f51e9c-944b-4062-b5fd-9a77638d983f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/04/science/00VIRUS-GLOBAL4/merlin_174091218_11f51e9c-944b-4062-b5fd-9a77638d983f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/04/science/00VIRUS-GLOBAL4/00VIRUS-GLOBAL4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStanda