mashing music publication where Lester Bangs did some of his most famous work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Jaan Uhelszki’s first day at Creem magazine in October 1970, she met a fellow new hire: Lester Bangs, a freelance writer freshly arrived from California to fill the post of record reviews editor. His plaid three-piece suit made him look like an awkward substitute teacher, she thought, and certainly out of place among the hippies and would-be revolutionaries using the publication’s decrepit Detroit office as a crash pad.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/04/arts/03creem1/merlin_175133154_635eccac-ba2f-45e8-abca-05e02cd73da5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 456, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/04/arts/03creem1/merlin_175133154_635eccac-ba2f-45e8-abca-05e02cd73da5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 456}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/04/arts/03creem1/merlin_175133154_635eccac-ba2f-45e8-abca-05e02cd73da5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 778, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/04/arts/03creem1/merlin_175133154_635eccac-ba2f-45e8-abca-05e02cd73da5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1555, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/04/arts/03creem1/03creem1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/04/arts/03creem1/03creem1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/04/arts/03creem1/03creem1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Wild Story of Creem, Once ‘America’s Only Rock ’n’ Roll Magazine’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Detroit Rock Crit: Creem Totally Defined It', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pop and Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Creem (Magazine)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bangs, Lester', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crawford, Scott (1972- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Detroit (Mich)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': "Creem: America's Only Rock 'n' Roll Magazine (Movie)", 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Uhelszki, Jaan', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-03T14:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Rubin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rubin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db4b6f0e-ee69-5cc2-81f0-e34e174f403d', 'word_count': 1683, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db4b6f0e-ee69-5cc2-81f0-e34e174f403d'}, {'abstract': 'Brush up on the basics, or lean into something new, whether it’s ginger-lime chicken or a pork schnitzel with quick pickles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/03/dining/cooking-as-craft.html', 'snippet': 'Brush up on the basics, or lean into something new, whether it’s ginger-lime chicken or a pork schnitzel with quick pickles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. “Manual competence” is the ideal Matthew Crawford speaks up for in his excellent 2010 book, “Shop Class as Soulcraft: An Inquiry Into the Value of Work.” Crawford’s a mechanic and a philosopher. He has no truck with craftsmanship or artistry. He speaks instead for the importance of trade work — “work that is meaningful because it is genuinely useful,” he writes. He finds that work engaging intellectually, and he finds in it an argument that celebrates responsibility and personal agency. (He’s a philosopher, remember.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/dining/aw-tomato-and-peach-salad-with-whipped-goat-cheese/merlin_157887927_dd555ee7-3af4-4efc-b3aa-dff8cbaba8bf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/22/dining/aw-tomato-and-peach-salad-with-whipped-goat-cheese/merlin_157887927_dd555ee7-3af4-4efc-b3aa-dff8cbaba8bf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/dining/aw-tomato-and-peach-salad-with-whipped-goat-cheese/merlin_157887927_dd555ee7-3af4-4efc-b3aa-dff8cbaba8bf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/22/dining/aw-tomato-and-peach-salad-with-whipped-goat-cheese/merlin_157887927_dd555ee7-3af4-4efc-b3aa-dff8cbaba8bf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo'