lue': 'Polsky, Gabe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Red Penguins (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Penguins', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-04T11:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Kenigsberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kenigsberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/6a8a9f9d-848f-51a5-a153-a93140a671ef', 'word_count': 403, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a8a9f9d-848f-51a5-a153-a93140a671ef'}, {'abstract': 'Three days after their boat ran out of fuel and drifted off course in Micronesia, the men were found in good condition after a plane saw their giant plea for help spelled out on the sand.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/04/world/australia/sos-pacific-island.html', 'snippet': 'Three days after their boat ran out of fuel and drifted off course in Micronesia, the men were found in good condition after a plane saw their giant plea for help spelled out on the sand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s a useful tip: If you ever find yourself stuck on an uninhabited island in the Pacific, it turns out that writing SOS in giant letters on the sand works.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '3 Men Marooned in the Pacific Are Rescued After Writing SOS in the Sand', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rescues', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Coast Guard', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Micronesia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pacific Ocean', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020