rticle/25059c8a-a480-5fad-8ad6-87ff039cabe7'}, {'abstract': 'For decades, the notion of the lone genius in the kitchen has fostered culinary creativity — and restaurants marred by abuse and unfairness. This may be the time for change.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/04/dining/chef-restaurant-culture.html', 'snippet': 'For decades, the notion of the lone genius in the kitchen has fostered culinary creativity — and restaurants marred by abuse and unfairness. This may be the time for change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Picture a great restaurant, the chef up at dawn, dusting hand-milled flour on a butcher’s block. The chef under a spotlight, tweezing chive blossoms in the chaos of the pass, or fanning the wood fire under a row of shimmering, trussed birds.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/dining/05Chefs-Centric-Cover-Illo/05Chefs-Centric-Cover-Illo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 618, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/05/dining/05Chefs-Centric-Cover-Illo/05Chefs-Centric-Cover-Illo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 618}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/dining/05Chefs-Centric-Cover-Illo/05Chefs-Centric-Cover-Illo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 995, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/dining/05Chefs-Centric-Cover-Illo/05Chefs-Centric-Cover-Illo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1989, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/dining/05Chefs-Centric-Cover-Illo/05Che