y.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEDNESDAY PUZZLE — This will be a quick one today, because I am writing the column at the same time that the Extremely Spunky Border terrier and I are battening down the hatches before the arrival of the tropical storm hitting the East Coast. You want exciting? Try banging out 800 words before you lose power and internet, all while moving planters and chairs. In the rain. Uphill. Both ways.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/crosswords/05wordplay-ed/05wordplay-ed-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 522, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/05/crosswords/05wordplay-ed/05wordplay-ed-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 522}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/crosswords/05wordplay-ed/05wordplay-ed-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 891, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/crosswords/05wordplay-ed/05wordplay-ed-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 891, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/crosswords/05wordplay-ed/05wordplay-ed-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/05/crosswords/05wordplay-ed/05wordplay-ed-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/crosswords/05wordplay-ed/05wordplay-ed-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name