nyt://article/e895f1b5-c90b-5faa-9079-78c77fef827c'}, {'abstract': 'We asked Ivo van Hove, Justin Peck, Du Yun and others to pick the music that moves them. Listen to their choices.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/05/arts/music/five-minutes-classical-music.html', 'snippet': 'We asked Ivo van Hove, Justin Peck, Du Yun and others to pick the music that moves them. Listen to their choices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the past, we’ve asked some of our favorite artists to choose the five minutes or so they would play to make their friends fall in love with classical music, the piano, opera, the cello and Mozart.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/arts/05fiveminutes-composers/05fiveminutes-composers-articleLarge.gif', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/05/arts/05fiveminutes-composers/05fiveminutes-composers-articleLarge.gif', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/arts/05fiveminutes-composers/05fiveminutes-composers-jumbo.gif', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/arts/05fiveminutes-composers/05fiveminutes-composers-superJumbo.gif', 'height': 675, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/05/arts/05fiveminutes-composers/05fiveminutes-composers-thumbStandard-v2.gif', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/05/arts/05fiveminutes-composers/05fiveminutes-composers-thumbS