icide, he says, and needs someone to bury him. For viewers unfamiliar with Kiarostami, watching more than an hour of such conversations was perplexing, even tedious.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/arts/06gateway-kiarostami12/merlin_175376397_79b294fb-4393-405e-b677-b08425902257-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/07/arts/06gateway-kiarostami12/merlin_175376397_79b294fb-4393-405e-b677-b08425902257-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/arts/06gateway-kiarostami12/merlin_175376397_79b294fb-4393-405e-b677-b08425902257-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/arts/06gateway-kiarostami12/merlin_175376397_79b294fb-4393-405e-b677-b08425902257-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1351, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/arts/06gateway-kiarostami12/merlin_175376397_79b294fb-4393-405e-b677-b08425902257-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/07/arts/06gateway-kiarostami12/merlin_175376397_79b294fb-4393-405e-b677-b08425902257-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/arts/06gateway-kiarostami12/merlin_175376397_79b294fb-4393-405e-b677-b0