ary convoy were traveling to Dawlat Abad District from Mazar-e-Sharif when a roadside bomb exploded near a Humvee in the Yakhdan village of the district. Eight N.D.S. officers and two soldiers were killed, and two others were wounded. Days later, in the same province, a car full of explosives was detonated close to a commando unit in Balkh District, killing two commandos and eight civilians, while wounding an additional 20 commandos and 45 civilians. The explosion destroyed many nearby houses and the Taliban claimed responsibility for the attack.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/06/magazine/06atwar-casualtyreport/merlin_175290609_5cd3519d-57a9-4bec-8411-81309525a069-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/06/magazine/06atwar-casualtyreport/merlin_175290609_5cd3519d-57a9-4bec-8411-81309525a069-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/06/magazine/06atwar-casualtyreport/merlin_175290609_5cd3519d-57a9-4bec-8411-81309525a069-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/06/magazine/06atwar-casualtyreport/merlin_175290609_5cd3519d-57a9-4bec-8411-81309525a069-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/06/magazine/06atwar-casualtyreport/merlin_175290609_5cd3519d-57a9-4bec-8411-81309525a069-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {