original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/49e31e76-32aa-55fc-a4e0-cece1eefc032', 'word_count': 59, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49e31e76-32aa-55fc-a4e0-cece1eefc032'}, {'abstract': 'Being single in your 30s can feel like waiting to enter a popular club, only to get in and think: What’s the big deal?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/07/style/modern-love-when-marriage-is-just-another-overhyped-nightclub.html', 'snippet': 'Being single in your 30s can feel like waiting to enter a popular club, only to get in and think: What’s the big deal?', 'lead_paragraph': 'People treat you differently when you are steadily single. Not everyone, not all the time, not always overtly, not necessarily unkindly. They ask why no one has snatched you up, offer to set you up on blind dates, seat you at the singles table at formal events. They extend last-minute invitations to dinner parties when someone else has bailed.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/fashion/09MODERN-MARRIAGECLUB/09MODERN-MARRIAGECLUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/09/fashion/09MODERN-MARRIAGECLUB/09MODERN-MARRIAGECLUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/fashion/09MODERN-MARRIAGECLUB/09MODERN-MARRIAGECLUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/fashion/09MODERN-MARRIAGECLUB/09MODERN-MARRIAGECLUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1295, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJum