 are signs of a healthier existence beginning to emerge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was going to write this week about what the world should take away from Melbourne’s resurgent outbreak and Stage 4 lockdown, but then I thought: Maybe we need an escape?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/world/07ausletter170b/07ausletter170b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/07/world/07ausletter170b/07ausletter170b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/world/07ausletter170b/07ausletter170b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/world/07ausletter170b/07ausletter170b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/world/07ausletter170b/07ausletter170b-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/07/world/07ausletter170b/07ausletter170b-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/world/07ausletter170b/07ausletter170b-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Smile, Australia. Look at What’s Flourishing Despite the Pandemic.', 'kicker': 'letter 170', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fishing, Sport', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-07T04:00:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Australia', 'byline': {'original': 'By Damien Cave', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Damien', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cave', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/242649cb-0c36-57c5-aed6-8b0d95f6f88e', 'word_count': 933, 'uri': 'nyt://article/242649cb-0c36-57c5-aed6-8b0d95f6f88e'}, {'abstract': 'Those trays that macarons come in? Plaxall makes them. But since the pandemic, it has pivoted to medical face shields. It’s not the first time the family business has done its patriotic duty.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/07/nyregion/coronavirus-ppe-nyc-face-shields.html', 'snippet': 'Those trays that macarons come in? Plaxall makes them. But since the pandemic, it has pivoted to medical face shields. It’s not the first time the family business has done its patriotic duty.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s rare these days to be a small and successful manufacturer in New York City. And perhaps even rarer for a family-owned business to pivot its operations several times in moments of national need — including participating in a mysterious and ultra-top-secret military contract that redefined modern warfare.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/nyregion/09nyvirus-p