th testing delays nationwide, experts are increasingly recommending a new type of rapid test that gives less accurate results. It is imperfect, but as one expert put it, “pretty good is a lot better than none.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/07/us/covid-test-accuracy-governor-dewine-ohio.html', 'snippet': 'With testing delays nationwide, experts are increasingly recommending a new type of rapid test that gives less accurate results. It is imperfect, but as one expert put it, “pretty good is a lot better than none.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Mike DeWine of Ohio received a negative coronavirus test result on Thursday, hours after a positive test result had stopped him from meeting with President Trump in Cleveland. The contradictory results during a high-profile moment underscored the challenges of testing, an issue that has repeatedly stymied the virus response in the United States.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/us/07virus-falsetest/merlin_175397583_d1017dc1-688b-4d65-b386-56dccfc71e9e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 349, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/07/us/07virus-falsetest/merlin_175397583_d1017dc1-688b-4d65-b386-56dccfc71e9e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 349}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/us/07virus-falsetest/merlin_175397583_d1017dc1-688b-4d65-b386-56dccfc71e9e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 596, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/us/07virus-falsetest/merlin_175397583_d1017dc1-688b-4d65-b386-56dccfc71e9e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1055, 'width': 1812, 'subType': 'superJumbo'