 start of the annual Sturgis Motorcycle Rally.', 'lead_paragraph': 'STURGIS, S.D. — Tens of thousands of motorcyclists roared into the western South Dakota community of Sturgis on Friday, lining Main Street from end to end, for the start of an annual rally that kicked off despite objections from residents and with little regard for a public health emergency ravaging the world.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘If We Get It, We Chose to Be Here’: Despite Virus, Thousands Converge on Sturgis for Huge Rally', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At Motorcycle Rally in South Dakota, ‘If We Get It, We Chose to Be Here’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sturgis (SD)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Motorcycles, Motor Bikes and Motorscooters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Masks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus Risks and Safety Concerns', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-07T23:38:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Walker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Walker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ec5208a-4afa-5f5d-967c-671161a445bc', 'word_count': 1042, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ec5208a-4afa-5f5d-967c-671161a445bc'}, {'abstract': 'No standing up, and definitely no cursing: The basketball superfan known as Bongo Lady takes us behind the screen as she is beamed into an N.B.A. game from her couch in Mississippi.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/07/sports/basketball/nba-virtual-fans.html', 'snippet': 'No standing up, and definitely no cursing: The basketball superfan known as Bongo Lady takes us behind the screen as she is beamed into an N.B.A. game from her couch in Mississippi.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Malenda Meacham usually watches the Memphis Grizzlies play their home games at FedEx Forum from her perch in Section 106. She stands. She cheers. She paces. And, of course, she pretends to pound on the cartoon bongos whenever they flash on the arena’s big screens.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/sports/07nba-virtualfans01/merlin_175441551_836c02b1-6cb4-4809-9f4c-b2600ec91b00-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/07/sports/07nba-virtualfans01/merlin_175441551_836c02b1-6cb4-4809-9f4c-b2600ec91b00-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/sports/07nba-virtualfans01/merlin_175441551_836c02b1-6cb4-4809-9f4c-b2600ec91b00-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/sports/07nba-virtualfans01/merlin_175441551_836c02b1-6cb4-4809-9f4c-b2600ec91b00-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/07/sports/07nba-virtualfans01/merlin_175441551_836c02b1-6cb4-4809-9f4c-b2600ec91b00-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/07/sports/07nba-virtualfans