ytimes.com/2020/08/07/at-home/covid-19-volunteer.html', 'snippet': 'Many students and their families are struggling. Here are some ideas to help your neighbors, your schools and your community.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you have already figured out how your family’s work and school situation might look this fall, remember other families might not be as secure. All parents want to stay or get healthy, give their children the best shot at an enriching school year and support themselves and their partners as they balance work and child-rearing — but this is an unprecedented, uncertain year. Millions of people are facing job loss, food insecurity, health problems and other worries in this ever-changing period.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/multimedia/09AH-familyresources/09AH-familyresources-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/09/multimedia/09AH-familyresources/09AH-familyresources-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 441}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/multimedia/09AH-familyresources/09AH-familyresources-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 752, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/multimedia/09AH-familyresources/09AH-familyresources-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1505, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/multimedia/09AH-familyresources/09AH-familyresources-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cro