 on some weight during lockdown. You can obsess over it, but you can also be kinder to yourself. Here’s how.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the explosion of lockdown-friendly home exercise programs and advice, it may seem as if it’s never been easier to work out at home. But the reality is, it’s probably never been harder. For every person posting a sweaty “crushed it” selfie on Instagram, there’s another one (or four) just trying to endure pandemic-induced stress. Add in constant access to the refrigerator and a pantry overstocked with panic buys, and the guilt about what we’ve eaten — or the exercise we haven’t done — piles on faster than you can say “Quarantine 15.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/multimedia/09AHweightgain/09AHweightgain-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 478, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/09/multimedia/09AHweightgain/09AHweightgain-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 478}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/multimedia/09AHweightgain/09AHweightgain-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 815, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/multimedia/09AHweightgain/09AHweightgain-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1630, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/multimedia/09AHweightgain/09AHweightgain-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/09/multimedia/09AHweightgain/09AHwe