 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-08T18:38:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Branch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Branch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6417fd3-a1c1-5a99-982b-a8786fdd5055', 'word_count': 1267, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6417fd3-a1c1-5a99-982b-a8786fdd5055'}, {'abstract': 'Lessons for coronavirus long-haulers from my own experience with chronic illness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/08/opinion/sunday/covid-lyme-treatment-medicine.html', 'snippet': 'Lessons for coronavirus long-haulers from my own experience with chronic illness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Among the many things that nobody knows about the disease that has overturned our lives is how long its effects last. I don’t just mean the possibility of coronavirus damage lurking invisibly in the heart or lungs or brain. I mean the simpler question of what it takes, and how long, for some uncertain percentage of the sick to actually feel better.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/opinion/sunday/09Douthat/09Douthat-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/09/opinion/sunday/09Douthat/09Douthat-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/opinion/sunday/09Douthat/09Douthat-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/opinion/sunday/09Douthat/09Douthat-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/opinion/sunday/09Douthat/09Douthat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/09/opinion/sunday/09Douthat/09Douthat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/opinion/sunday/09Douthat/09Douthat-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Do When Covid Doesn’t Go Away', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What to Do When Covid Doesn’t Go Away', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lyme Disease', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Content Type: Service', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus Risks and Safety Concerns', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Douthat, Ross G', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chronic Condition (Health)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-08T19:27:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/09dffa86-cd3d-5662-8502-9e275dcaa421', 'word_count': 1180, 'uri': 'nyt://article/09dffa86-cd3d-5662-8502-9e275dcaa421'}, {'abstract': '“Wicked Game” is slated for release in October, at the height of the presidential campaign, but Mr. Gates says, “It’s not a salacious book.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/08/books/rick-gates-trump-mueller-wicked-game.html', 'snippet': '“Wicked Game” is slated for release in October, at the height of the presidential campaign, but Mr. Gates says, “It’s not a salacious book.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'He was the star witness in the Russia investigation, whose testimony helped convict two powerful advisers to the president. Now, Rick Gates, a high-level aide on Donald J. Trump’s 2016 campaign, is preparing to tell his story in a memoir that will be published weeks before the 2020 election.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/08/books/08rickgates-pix1/merlin_166093218_371e47a8-9f76-4e37-b573-1ef28e363858-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/08/books/08rickgates-pix1/merlin_166093218_371e47a8-9f76-4e37-b573-1ef28e363858-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/08/books/08rickgates-pix1/merlin_166093218_371e47a8-9f76-4e37-b573-1ef28e363858-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/08/books/08rickgates-pix1/merlin_166093218_371e47a8-9f76-4e37-b573-1ef28e363858-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/08/books/08rickgates-pix1/08rickgates-pix1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/08/books/08rickgates-pix1/08rickgates-pix1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/08/books/08rickgates-pix1/08rickgates-pix1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rick Gates, Ex-Trump Aide and Mueller Witness, Is Publishing a Memoir', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian Interference in 2016 US Elections and Ties to Trump Associates', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gates, Richard W III (1972- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mueller, Robert S III', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': "Wicked Game: An Insider's Story on How Trump Won, Mueller Failed, and America Lost (Book)", 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-08T19:45:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Books', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexandra Alter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c98aab89-9380-5c49-9375-6b05db5210bd', 'word_count': 1058, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c98aab89-9380-5c49-9375-6b05db5210bd'}, {'abstract': 'As national security adviser, he voiced strong opinions and acted on them, especially when it came to Beijing and Moscow.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/08/opinion/brent-scowcroft-model-foreign-policy.html', 'snippet': 'As national security adviser, he voiced strong opinions and acted on them, especially when it came to Beijing and Moscow.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It became known in foreign policy circles as “the Scowcroft model.” Brent Scowcroft, the former national security adviser for Presidents Gerald Ford and George H.W. Bush, who died Thursday, was frequently praised for establishing a paradigm for doing that job that many of his successors attempted (or claimed) to follow. The irony is that the real Brent Scowcroft, a man of strong views, didn’t always fit the paradigm himself.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/08/opinion/08mann-pix/merlin_104153902_5d976a03-a2cf-4e13-aa87-cc7b83a2815f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/08/opinion/08mann-pix/merlin_104153902_5d976a03-a2cf-4e13-aa87-cc7b83a2815f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/08/opinion/08mann-pix/merlin_104153902_5d976a03-a2cf-4e13-aa87-cc7b83a2815f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2