ion and bring the city to heel.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hong Kong Arrests Jimmy Lai, Media Mogul, Under National Security Law', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Arrests Target Press Freedom In Hong Kong', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lai, Jimmy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hong Kong', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hong Kong Protests (2019)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-10T01:41:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Austin Ramzy and Tiffany May', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Austin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramzy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Tiffany', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'May', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/529584d3-ee22-5e54-8c65-5361506679b0', 'word_count': 1378, 'uri': 'nyt://article/529584d3-ee22-5e54-8c65-5361506679b0'}, {'abstract': 'On Della’s advice, Perry calls an unexpected witness to the stand. Will the gamble pay off?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/09/arts/television/perry-mason-finale-recap.html', 'snippet': 'On Della’s advice, Perry calls an unexpected witness to the stand. Will the gamble pay off?', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s all connected. This is Perry Mas