ings plunged more than 73 percent compared to a year ago, as lockdowns imposed to curb the coronavirus pandemic drastically cut the demand for oil and slammed prices. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/10/business/saudi-aramcos-profit-fell-73-percent-as-demand-for-oil-shrank.html', 'snippet': '', 'lead_paragraph': 'Saudi Aramco, the world’s largest oil company, said on Sunday that its quarterly earnings plunged more than 73 percent compared to a year ago, as lockdowns imposed to curb the coronavirus pandemic drastically cut the demand for oil and slammed prices. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/10/world/09saudiaramco-print/merlin_173789850_7303a598-4c02-448a-9fee-7c2209e2cee9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/10/world/09saudiaramco-print/merlin_173789850_7303a598-4c02-448a-9fee-7c2209e2cee9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/10/world/09saudiaramco-print/merlin_173789850_7303a598-4c02-448a-9fee-7c2209e2cee9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/10/world/09saudiaramco-print/merlin_173789850_7303a598-4c02-448a-9fee-7c2209e2cee9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/10/world/09saudiaramco-print/09saudiaramco-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/10/world/09s