pt at that was to go and buy a sketchbook.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/10/t-magazine/art/Tadobe-slide-HVS6/Tadobe-slide-HVS6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/10/t-magazine/art/Tadobe-slide-HVS6/Tadobe-slide-HVS6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/10/t-magazine/art/Tadobe-slide-HVS6/Tadobe-slide-HVS6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/10/t-magazine/art/Tadobe-slide-HVS6/Tadobe-slide-HVS6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/10/t-magazine/art/Tadobe-slide-HVS6/Tadobe-slide-HVS6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/10/t-magazine/art/Tadobe-slide-HVS6/Tadobe-slide-HVS6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/10/t-magazine/art/Tadobe-slide-HVS6/Tadobe-slide-HVS6-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Artist Making Bulbous, Colorful Sculptures Out of Thrifted Clothes', 'kicker': 'T Presents', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sculpture', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Textiles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Van Doren Waxter (Manhattan, NY, Gallery)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-10T11:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Merrell Hambleton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Merrell', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hambleton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/586bbbbe-e893-5b18-a591-daec0f60d5be', 'word_count': 1185, 'uri': 'nyt://article/586bbbbe-e893-5b18-a591-daec0f60d5be'}, {'abstract': 'With help from those in her creative community, Pierre Davis has created a truly inclusive brand in No Sesso.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/10/t-magazine/pierre-davis-no-sesso.html', 'snippet': 'With help from those in her creative community, Pierre Davis has created a truly inclusive brand in No Sesso.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One February during New York Fashion Week, rays of sunlight poured through the windows of Chelsea’s Pier 59 Studios, setting off a glimmer of rhinestones across the butt of a belly-bearing gray velour tracksuit. As the model Maya Monés, her ’60s-inspired shoulder-length wig flipped upward at the ends, made the customary spin at the edge of the catwalk, she brushed her palms across two short words spelled out by the gems, the declaration of a singular presence: “No Sesso.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/10/t-magazine/art/Tadobe-slide-UHN3/Tadobe-slide-UHN3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge':