': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/10/business/heres-the-business-news-to-watch-this-week.html', 'snippet': '', 'lead_paragraph': '🗣 It’s a relatively light week for earnings, with a majority of the S&P 500 having already reported their latest quarterly results. Notable releases include Simon Property Group on Monday; InterContinental Hotels and SoftBank on Tuesday; Cisco, Lyft and Tencent on Wednesday; and Applied Materials and Deutsche Telekom on Thursday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Here’s the business news to watch this week.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2020-08-10T12:51:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jason Karaian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jason', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Karaian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/306ce184-c5d8-5140-924d-a5c129a6c022', 'word_count': 149, 'uri': 'nyt://article/306ce184-c5d8-5140-924d-a5c129a6c022'}, {'abstract': 'Tom Rauffenbart had resolved to create a tribute to his partner, the artist David Wojnarowicz. A sewing circle of women took up the cause for both men, stitching through lockdown.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/10/arts/design/aids-quilts-david-wojnarowicz-.html', 'snippet': 'Tom Rauffenbart had resolved to create a tribute to his partner, the artist David Wojnarowicz. A sewing circle of women took up the cause for both men, stitching through lockdown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since the fall of 2019, six women, some from the art world, others retired social workers, had labored on two AIDS quilts devoted to the memories of the artist David Wojnarowicz and his partner, Tom Rauffenbart. The women converged from all over New York City on the neighborhood of Washington Heights, at the home of Anita Vitale, who had met Mr. Rauffenbart, a fellow social worker, in the 1980s.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/arts/09aidsquilt1/merlin_175489713_5e69e0d5-37aa-4b88-b57c-334e618f9f38-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/09/arts/09aidsquilt1/merlin_175489713_5e69e0d5-37aa-4b88-b57c-334e618f9f38-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/arts/09aidsquilt1/merlin_175489713_5e69e0d5-37aa-4b88-b57c-334e618f9f38-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/arts/09aidsquilt1/merlin_175489713_5e69e0d5-37aa-4b88-b57c-334e618f9f38-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/arts/09aidsquilt1/09aidsquilt1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/09/arts/09aidsquilt1/09aidsquilt1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/09/arts/09aidsquilt1/09aidsquilt1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'AIDS Quilts for an Artist and His Partner, Sewn During a New Pandemic', 'kicker