'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/11/style/leandra-medine-ari-seth-cohen-instagram-influencers.html', 'snippet': 'Robbed of a real-life stage, the frustrated fashion faithful continue to pull out all the stops on Instagram.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last summer Nicole Gordon posted an Instagram snap of herself framed in a doorway at home. In a slinky sleeveless dress, vivid makeup and towering heels, Ms. Gordon, a writer and art adviser, was the picture of cocktail-hour glamour.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/13/fashion/11FASHIONJUNKIES-1/merlin_175268004_83e60a07-db4b-41af-b249-55bde413c2b8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/13/fashion/11FASHIONJUNKIES-1/merlin_175268004_83e60a07-db4b-41af-b249-55bde413c2b8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/13/fashion/11FASHIONJUNKIES-1/merlin_175268004_83e60a07-db4b-41af-b249-55bde413c2b8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/13/fashion/11FASHIONJUNKIES-1/merlin_175268004_83e60a07-db4b-41af-b249-55bde413c2b8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/13/fashion/11FASHIONJUNKIES-1/11FASHIONJUNKIES-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/13/fashion/11FASHIONJUNKIES-1/11FASHIONJUNKIES-1-thumbStandard.jp