ith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a314de1e-5490-5069-a3fd-ef92897a13f9', 'word_count': 1931, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a314de1e-5490-5069-a3fd-ef92897a13f9'}, {'abstract': 'Kamala Harris, Russian vaccine, Belarus: Here’s what you need to know.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/12/briefing/kamala-harris-russian-vaccine-belarus.html', 'snippet': 'Kamala Harris, Russian vaccine, Belarus: Here’s what you need to know.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Former Vice President Joe Biden named Senator Kamala Harris of California on Tuesday as his running mate in the U.S. presidential election in November. She is the first Black woman and first person of Indian descent to be nominated for national office on a major party ticket.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/briefing/12ambriefing-euro-promo/12ambriefing-euro-slide-96T6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/12/briefing/12ambriefing-euro-promo/12ambriefing-euro-slide-96T6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/briefing/12ambriefing-euro-promo/12ambriefing-euro-slide-96T6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/briefing/12ambriefing-euro-promo/12ambriefing-euro-slide-96T6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/briefing/12ambriefing-euro-promo/12ambriefing-euro-slide-96T6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/12/briefing/12ambriefing-euro-promo/12ambriefing-euro-slide-96T6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/briefing/12ambriefing-euro-promo/12ambriefing-euro-slide-96T6-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Your Wednesday Briefing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2020-08-12T04:47:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NYTNow', 'section_name': 'Briefing', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isabella Kwai', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isabella', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kwai', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'briefing', '_id': 'nyt://article/c96fd98c-7049-523c-9587-a7c3b5ce2539', 'word_count': 1490, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c96fd98c-7049-523c-9587-a7c3b5ce2539'}, {'abstract': '“Yusuf Hawkins: Storm Over Brooklyn” debuts on HBO. And a film about the band the Go-Go’s airs on Showtime.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/12/arts/television/whats-on-tv-wednesday-yusuf-hawkins-storm-over-brooklyn-the-go-gos.html', 'snippet': '“Yusuf Hawkins: Storm Over Brooklyn” debuts on HBO. And a film about the band the Go-Go’s airs on Showtime.', 'lead_paragraph': 'YUSUF HAWKINS: STORM OVER BROOKLYN (2020) 9 p.m. on HBO. Thirty-one years ago this month, Yusuf Hawkins was killed in the Bensonhurst neighborhood of Brooklyn, in what became one of the city’s most notorious hate crimes and a sign of its racial divisions in the 1980s and ’90s. This documentary revisits the case — in which Hawkins, a Black teenager, was pursued by a mob of white youths, then shot — through archival footage and interviews with Hawkins’s family. Also interviewed are public figures like the Rev. Al Sharpton, who led protests after the killing and helped turn the case into an argument for change. “I don’t know who shot Yusuf,” Sharpton said at Hawkins’s funeral in 1989, “but the system loaded the gun.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/arts/12tvcol-yusuf/12tvcol-yusuf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/12/arts/12tvcol-yusuf/12tvcol-yusuf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/arts/12tvcol-yusuf/12tvcol-yusuf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/arts/12tvcol-yusuf/12tvcol-yusuf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/arts/12tvcol-yusuf/12tvcol-yusuf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/12/arts/12tvcol-yusuf/12tvcol-yusuf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/arts/12tvcol-yusuf/12tvcol-yusuf-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'su