 — and hope you won’t bother to think about it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/12/opinion/census-politics-gerrymandering-redistricting.html', 'snippet': 'Party strategists pay a lot of attention to redrawing district maps — and hope you won’t bother to think about it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some of the most important developments in politics do not happen every election cycle, but every ten years, when politicians scrap the old battleground map and struggle to replace it with a new one more favorable to their interests.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/opinion/12edsall1/merlin_165332970_b1099835-ad08-4ead-a827-5e8cda7daa8d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/12/opinion/12edsall1/merlin_165332970_b1099835-ad08-4ead-a827-5e8cda7daa8d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 367}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/opinion/12edsall1/merlin_165332970_b1099835-ad08-4ead-a827-5e8cda7daa8d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 626, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/opinion/12edsall1/merlin_165332970_b1099835-ad08-4ead-a827-5e8cda7daa8d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1251, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/12/opinion/12edsall1/12edsall1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/12/opinion/12edsall1/12edsall1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {