bstract': 'As Britain struggles to rid itself of the coronavirus, pent-up demand and a volatile market are spurring a frenzy of interest from home buyers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/12/realestate/house-hunting-in-london-once-a-dark-garage-now-an-airy-light-box.html', 'snippet': 'As Britain struggles to rid itself of the coronavirus, pent-up demand and a volatile market are spurring a frenzy of interest from home buyers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This three-bedroom home, converted over the past two years from an auto mechanic’s garage, is just down the street from Mile End Park in East London. The modern design incorporates below-ground and staggered levels to maximize the house’s 1,600 square feet of living space, with a central glass atrium that runs from top to bottom.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/realestate/12IHH-London-slide-7ZXN/12IHH-London-slide-7ZXN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/16/realestate/12IHH-London-slide-7ZXN/12IHH-London-slide-7ZXN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/realestate/12IHH-London-slide-7ZXN/12IHH-London-slide-7ZXN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/realestate/12IHH-London-slide-7ZXN/12IHH-London-slide-7ZXN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/realestate/12IHH-London-slide-7ZXN/12IHH-London-slide-7ZXN-thum