showrunners began working on pandemic-themed series that could be shot mostly from afar. But will viewers even want more shut-in stories?', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a sun-dazzled morning in early July, the actor Leslie Odom Jr. readied himself for another take. At a marble-topped table in a Los Angeles bungalow, he pecked at a laptop, waiting for the actress playing his wife to enter. This was midway through a three-day shoot for “Love in the Time of Corona,” a Freeform limited series that premieres on Aug. 22.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16coronavirus-tv5/merlin_175267434_d43c20a6-e3ce-4732-972a-9afe86d8a1df-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16coronavirus-tv5/merlin_175267434_d43c20a6-e3ce-4732-972a-9afe86d8a1df-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16coronavirus-tv5/merlin_175267434_d43c20a6-e3ce-4732-972a-9afe86d8a1df-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16coronavirus-tv5/merlin_175267434_d43c20a6-e3ce-4732-972a-9afe86d8a1df-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 1280, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16coronavirus-tv5/16coronavirus-tv5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16coronavirus-tv5/16coronavirus-tv5-thu