 roll for a meal you’re not likely to soon forget.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/12/dining/back-to-sandwich-city.html', 'snippet': 'Fry up some shrimp and tuck it into a torpedo roll for a meal you’re not likely to soon forget.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. My friend Michael Gentile used to make these soft-shell crab sandwiches, the crabs fried in butter with a dusting of flour and Old Bay seasoning, on white bread with mayonnaise and really ripe summer tomatoes, and I got it into my head that I had to have one of those this August, preferably right away. But there were no peelers to be had at the fishmongers I visited, day after day. I was always 10 minutes too late. “We had them earlier,” said the man in the mask, inevitably, stomping his deck boots on the wet concrete floor.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/12/magazine/12mag-eat-image1/12mag-eat-image1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/08/12/magazine/12mag-eat-image1/12mag-eat-image1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/12/magazine/12mag-eat-image1/12mag-eat-image1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/12/magazine/12mag-eat-image1/12mag-eat-image1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/12/magazine/12mag-eat-image1/12mag-eat-image1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail',