cce618e69', 'word_count': 1599, 'uri': 'nyt://article/be8b2c46-f76a-5433-b39e-98ccce618e69'}, {'abstract': 'The first two webinars in our back-to-school series are all about using The Learning Network to help you bring the world to your students, for free.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/13/learning/webinars-on-teaching-and-learning-with-the-new-york-times.html', 'snippet': 'The first two webinars in our back-to-school series are all about using The Learning Network to help you bring the world to your students, for free.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We’ll be hosting dozens of professional development webinars for teachers during this school year on ways to teach and learn with The New York Times and The Learning Network — all for free. We know we’ll all need to be supporting one another through what promises to be a challenging year of teaching and learning amid a pandemic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/13/learning/IntroWebinarsLN/IntroWebinarsLN-articleLarge.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/13/learning/IntroWebinarsLN/IntroWebinarsLN-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/13/learning/IntroWebinarsLN/IntroWebinarsLN-jumbo.png', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/13/learning/IntroWebinarsLN/IntroWebinarsLN-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/13/learning/IntroWebinarsLN/IntroWebinars