unt': 1020, 'uri': 'nyt://article/65587e6f-093e-5fbf-87f6-4661e53be0c8'}, {'abstract': 'A biking challenge known as “Everesting” — hill repeats equal in distance to the climb up the mountain — is catching on, with records rapidly falling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/13/sports/cycling/everesting-challenge-cycling-records.html', 'snippet': 'A biking challenge known as “Everesting” — hill repeats equal in distance to the climb up the mountain — is catching on, with records rapidly falling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As my altimeter clicked past 27,000 feet for the day — into the range of the low oxygen “death zone” on Mount Everest — and my eyes blurred with sweat and sunscreen, a white Ferrari accelerated past me into a curve.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/14/sports/14cycling-everesting4-print/merlin_174605808_4463ce79-a089-439b-8a45-1b611d76f623-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/14/sports/14cycling-everesting4-print/merlin_174605808_4463ce79-a089-439b-8a45-1b611d76f623-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/14/sports/14cycling-everesting4-print/merlin_174605808_4463ce79-a089-439b-8a45-1b611d76f623-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/14/sports/14cycling-everesting4-print/merlin_174605808_4463ce79-a089-439b-8a45-1b611d76f623-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit':