0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/966d8276-9a56-5f9a-87a2-1d1b2f0c804f'}, {'abstract': 'A fish-out-of-water sports comedy on Apple TV+ takes folksiness to a new level of sophistication.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/14/arts/television/ted-lasso-review.html', 'snippet': 'A fish-out-of-water sports comedy on Apple TV+ takes folksiness to a new level of sophistication.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You could hear that the new Apple TV+ sitcom “Ted Lasso” is based on a pair of one-joke video promos, made for NBC Sports, and have a “What is the world coming to?” moment. But that would just mean you had forgotten about “Cavemen” (2007), based on a series of Geico ads, or “Hey Vern, It’s Ernest” (1988), an outgrowth of local spots featuring the supremely annoying Ernest P. Worrell.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/14/arts/14lasso/merlin_175127253_95089cb0-68e7-4127-9d9a-dd9e1d3442dd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/14/arts/14lasso/merlin_175127253_95089cb0-68e7-4127-9d9a-dd9e1d3442dd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/14/arts/14lasso/merlin_175127253_95089cb0-68e7-4127-9d9a-dd9e1d3442dd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/14/arts/14lasso/merlin_175127253_95089cb0-68e7-4127-9d9a-dd9e1d3442dd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/14/ar