_count': 931, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0ae1363-0de9-52ca-a683-869a5653384d'}, {'abstract': 'For years, the young outfielder has been too flawed to play full-time but too talented to trade away. Now, a series of Yankees injuries has given him a fresh chance to make his mark.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/14/sports/baseball/clint-frazier-yankees.html', 'snippet': 'For years, the young outfielder has been too flawed to play full-time but too talented to trade away. Now, a series of Yankees injuries has given him a fresh chance to make his mark.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two days after making his first-ever opening day roster at age 25, Clint Frazier was demoted. The Yankees removed him from their active roster and sent him to their alternate site in Pennsylvania, a new feature for the 2020 season for reserve players to stay fresh.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/15/sports/14yankees-frazier-print/merlin_175633764_37718d15-d63e-4ede-84c6-ffc46534cdc3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/15/sports/14yankees-frazier-print/merlin_175633764_37718d15-d63e-4ede-84c6-ffc46534cdc3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/15/sports/14yankees-frazier-print/merlin_175633764_37718d15-d63e-4ede-84c6-ffc46534cdc3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/15/sports/14yankees-frazier-print/merlin_175633764_37718d15-d63e-4ede-84c6-ffc46534cdc3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'super