tankard-jeremy-hermione-yorick-and-bones.html', 'snippet': 'Jeremy and Hermione Tankard’s “Yorick and Bones: The Last Graphic Novel by William Shakespeare” is poignant tickle-your-ribs entertainment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This charming spoof purports to be a long-lost work for younger readers by the Bard of Avon himself. But the reality of YORICK AND BONES: The Last Graphic Novel by William Shakespeare (HarperAlley, 144 pp., $16.99; ages 8 to 12), and its own secret origin, is even more charming.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/26/books/review/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 769, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/07/26/books/review/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 769}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/26/books/review/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/26/books/review/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1599, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/26/books/review/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/07/26/books/review/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS/26-BKS-NORTH_KIDS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption'