{'abstract': 'A relentless campaigner, he served for 14 years after winning an election to a special two-year term in 1976.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/15/us/james-thompson-dead.html', 'snippet': 'A relentless campaigner, he served for 14 years after winning an election to a special two-year term in 1976.', 'lead_paragraph': 'James R. Thompson, a moderate Republican known as Big Jim, who used his enthusiasm for campaigning and his canny understanding of state politics to become the longest-serving governor of Illinois, died on Friday in Chicago. He was 84.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/17/multimedia/15xp-thompson-pix/15xp-thompson-pix-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/17/multimedia/15xp-thompson-pix/15xp-thompson-pix-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 661}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/17/multimedia/15xp-thompson-pix/15xp-thompson-pix-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 930, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/17/multimedia/15xp-thompson-pix/15xp-thompson-pix-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1908, 'width': 1731, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/17/multimedia/15xp-thompson-pix/15xp-thompson-pix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/17/multimedia/15xp-thompson-pix/15xp-thompson-pix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thu