Courtney B. Vance) and his friend Letitia (Jurnee Smollett) to navigate 1950s New England in search of his missing father. In an article about the series, Salamishah Tillet wrote that its showrunner, Misha Green, also references “works by literary figures like James Baldwin and Ntozake Shange to create a provocative show that is landing amid a broader national conversation about race and representation.”', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16tvcol-lovecraft/merlin_175126611_00ca2aaa-4265-4e00-9b43-8ffa5354d5e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16tvcol-lovecraft/merlin_175126611_00ca2aaa-4265-4e00-9b43-8ffa5354d5e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16tvcol-lovecraft/merlin_175126611_00ca2aaa-4265-4e00-9b43-8ffa5354d5e5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16tvcol-lovecraft/merlin_175126611_00ca2aaa-4265-4e00-9b43-8ffa5354d5e5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1280, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16tvcol-lovecraft/16tvcol-lovecraft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/16/arts/16tvcol-lovecraft/16tvcol-lovecraft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'captio