ect', 'value': 'Monuments and Memorials (Structures)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Slavery (Historical)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Virginia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jefferson, Thomas', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Charlottesville (Va)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-16T09:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Holland Cotter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Holland', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cotter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b763283-33da-520b-b614-fb0e33476b92', 'word_count': 1766, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b763283-33da-520b-b614-fb0e33476b92'}, {'abstract': 'Many Bhutanese immigrants who drive for ride-sharing services opted to live off their savings during coronavirus-related lockdowns in New York City. As they begin to return to work, their country’s national pastime has been a comfort.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/16/sports/bhutan-archery-uber-drivers.html', 'snippet': 'Many Bhutanese immigrants who drive for ride-sharing services opted to live off their savings during coronavirus-related lockdowns in New York City. As they begin to return to work, their country’s national pastime has been a comfort.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tshelthrim Dorji, a 36-year-old from Bhutan, had been used to waking up every day at 5 a.m. to start his 12-hour-shift as an Uber driver in New York City. He stopped going out during the prolonged pandemic-related lockdown, and as he slowly returned to work as the city reopened this summer he found his already taxing job increasingly stressful.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/17/sports/12drivers-archery1-print/merlin_175589244_11b94a53-9c69-40c4-a141-d94045875b66-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/17/sports/12drivers-archery1-print/merlin_175589244_11b94a53-9c69-40c4-a141-d94045875b66-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/17/sports/12drivers-archery1-print/merlin_175589244_11b94a53-9c69-40c4-a141-d94045875b66-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/17/sports/12drivers-archery1-print/merlin_175589244_11b94a53-9c69-40c4-a141-d94045875b66-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/17/sports/12drivers-archery1-print/merlin_175589244_11b94a53-9c69-40c4-a141-d94045875b66-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/17/sports/12drivers-archery1-print/merlin_175589244_11b94a53-9c69-40c4-a141-d94045875b66-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/17/sports/12drivers-archery1-print/merlin_175589244_11b94a53-9c69-40c4-a141-d94045