isis-has-states-pressing-for-alternatives-to-mail-in-votes.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Tuesday, August 18, 2020.', 'lead_paragraph': '“We will make it painfully clear where that drop box is to every voter. I want to have a 30-day parade of cars going to that one location.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: Postal Crisis Has States Pressing for Alternatives to Mail-In Votes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2020-08-18T04:18:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e3bf073-cbfd-5371-b261-1fd1e2ed8b91', 'word_count': 49, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e3bf073-cbfd-5371-b261-1fd1e2ed8b91'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Tuesday, Aug. 18, 2020.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/18/pageoneplus/corrections-aug-18-2020.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Tuesday, Aug. 18, 2020.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article on Sunday about an increased demands for tuition rebates as colleges move to online instruction referred incorrectly to a petition to the University of North Carolina system that has attracted more than 40,000 signatures. It is a plea to the university to refund student housing charges in the event of another Covid-19 related shutdown, not to house students in that event. The article also misstated the University of Wisconsin-Madison’s reopening plans; the university will begin the fall semester with some classes held in person but most held remotely; it will not be relying entirely on remote classes.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: Aug. 18, 2020', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2020-08-18T04:25:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/043e2a79-a1c9-554f-ab17-06c16002e47d', 'word_count': 432, 'uri': 'nyt://article/043e2a79-a1c9-554f-ab17-06c16002e47d'}, {'abstract': 'In his D.N.C. Speech, Bernie Sanders described the policy decisions that will separate Joe Biden from President Trump.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000007294045/sanders-dnc-speech-policy.html', 'snippet': 'In his D.N.C. Speech, Bernie Sanders described the policy decisions that will separate Joe Biden from President Trump.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his D.N.C. Speech, Bernie Sanders described the policy decisions that will separate Joe Biden from President Trump.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/17/us/politics/Sanders2/Sanders2-articleLarge.png', 'height': 336, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/09/17/us/politics/Sanders2/Sanders2-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 336}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/17/us/politics/Sanders2/Sanders2-jumbo.png', 'height': 573, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/17/us/politics/Sanders2/Sanders2-superJumbo.png', 'height': 820, 'width': 1466, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': 