e/a3579ec1-8cb6-57de-af50-d3becb428926'}, {'abstract': 'After a long and involved investigation, a U.N.-backed tribunal emerged with only a single conviction, of a minor Hezbollah figure, in the 2005 bombing that killed the former prime minister of Lebanon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/18/world/middleeast/hariri-assassination-trial-hague.html', 'snippet': 'After a long and involved investigation, a U.N.-backed tribunal emerged with only a single conviction, of a minor Hezbollah figure, in the 2005 bombing that killed the former prime minister of Lebanon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The case went to trial in a country far from the crime scene with none of the accused in custody. It cost hundreds of millions of dollars to prosecute and employed armies of investigators, researchers and lawyers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/18/world/18lebanon-tribunal/merlin_175808475_3133173f-d6b3-46e3-beb2-bbfd1bae20fd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 474, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/18/world/18lebanon-tribunal/merlin_175808475_3133173f-d6b3-46e3-beb2-bbfd1bae20fd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 474}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/18/world/18lebanon-tribunal/merlin_175808475_3133173f-d6b3-46e3-beb2-bbfd1bae20fd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/18/world/18lebanon-tribunal/merlin_175808475_3133173f-d6b3-46e3-beb2-bbfd1bae20fd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1617, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 