-5834-ad98-150b1abc3909'}, {'abstract': 'Her cases were often precedent-setting and helped shift French laws and attitudes about abortion and women’s rights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/18/world/gisele-halimi-influential-french-lawyer-and-feminist-dies-at-93.html', 'snippet': 'Her cases were often precedent-setting and helped shift French laws and attitudes about abortion and women’s rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gisèle Halimi, a French lawyer, activist and author who championed feminist causes and other human rights efforts for more than seven decades, playing a key role in the decriminalization of abortion in France, died at her home in Paris on July 28, one day after her 93rd birthday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/obituaries/17Halimi1/merlin_175027857_c9150e6c-203a-4193-9043-b78dc37d8215-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/19/obituaries/17Halimi1/merlin_175027857_c9150e6c-203a-4193-9043-b78dc37d8215-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 417}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/obituaries/17Halimi1/merlin_175027857_c9150e6c-203a-4193-9043-b78dc37d8215-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 712, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/obituaries/17Halimi1/merlin_175027857_c9150e6c-203a-4193-9043-b78dc37d8215-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1424, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/obituaries/17Halimi1/17Halimi1-thumbSt