lockdown, a golfer long known for her promise appears to be fulfilling it as she arrives at the Women’s British Open.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/19/sports/golf/danielle-kang-womens-british-open.html', 'snippet': 'With two wins since the lockdown, a golfer long known for her promise appears to be fulfilling it as she arrives at the Women’s British Open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The golfer Danielle Kang has a small tattoo on her right index finger to remind her of her parents’ advice to be herself. “Just be,” it reads. But those words took on added meaning after the coronavirus crisis shut down the L.P.G.A. Tour in February, and Kang found herself atop a receding wave.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/sports/19kang1/merlin_175522974_204d1167-9253-4280-86fd-d6da7d1cd985-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/19/sports/19kang1/merlin_175522974_204d1167-9253-4280-86fd-d6da7d1cd985-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/sports/19kang1/merlin_175522974_204d1167-9253-4280-86fd-d6da7d1cd985-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/sports/19kang1/merlin_175522974_204d1167-9253-4280-86fd-d6da7d1cd985-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/sports/19kang1/merlin_175522974_204d1167-9253-4280-86fd-d6da7d1cd985-thumbStan