t': 46, 'uri': 'nyt://article/76271a9a-47a4-5eaf-8096-8da5565de5be'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Thursday, Aug. 20, 2020.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/19/pageoneplus/corrections-aug-20-2020.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Thursday, Aug. 20, 2020.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article on Friday about Beirut’s Shiite community misstated when Lebanon’s power-sharing system was put in place. It was in existence before the country’s civil war; it was not adopted after the war. The article also overstated what is known about the country’s demographic composition. No reliable census data on the current population is available; it is not clear whether Shiites represent the largest sect of Islam in the country.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: Aug. 20, 2020', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2020-08-20T02:26:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/47a7a0f5-55d1-5277-b334-1debfac66bff', 'word_count': 222, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47a7a0f5-55d1-5277-b334-1debfac66bff'}, {'abstract': 'As she endorsed Joe Biden during the Democratic National Convention, Gov. Michelle Lujan Grisham called for action to combat the existential crisis of climate change.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/elections/100000007297726/michelle-lujan-grisham-speaks-dnc.html', 'snippet': 'As she endorsed Joe Biden during the Democratic National Convention, Gov. Michelle Lujan Grisham called for action to combat the existential crisis of climate change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As she endorsed Joe Biden during the Democratic National Convention, Gov. Michelle Lujan G