sult. Now I read it with pride for brave people who speak out publicly for respect and justice, for passionate poets like Alison Luterman, for the people who live through “every kind of exile” … for all the awkwardness of trying on “new wings.” And for a country that has prided itself on being so forward-thinking without ever electing one of those girls to be even vice president, much less president. This poem feels like an anthem for “ferocious mercy” to come. Selected by Naomi Shihab Nye', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/magazine/23mag-poem-1/23mag-poem-1-articleLarge.png', 'height': 468, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/23/magazine/23mag-poem-1/23mag-poem-1-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 468}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/magazine/23mag-poem-1/23mag-poem-1-jumbo.png', 'height': 748, 'width': 959, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/magazine/23mag-poem-1/23mag-poem-1-superJumbo.png', 'height': 748, 'width': 959, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/magazine/23mag-poem-1/23mag-poem-1-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/23/magazine/23mag-poem-1/23mag-poem-1-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/magazine/23mag-poem-1/23mag-poem-1-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Poem: Some Girls', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Some Girls', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poetry and Poets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ocasio-Cortez, Alexandria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-20T09:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alison Luterman and Naomi Shihab Nye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alison', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Luterman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Naomi', 'middlename': 'Shihab', 'lastname': 'Nye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a005879-bfb5-5437-a008-a4d25d748136', 'word_count': 319, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a005879-bfb5-5437-a008-a4d25d748136'}, {'abstract': 'Building a safe digital environment is essential to making remote learning work, experts say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/20/parenting/online-school-privacy.html', 'snippet': 'Building a safe digital environment is essential to making remote learning work, experts say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Millions of students will attend school online this fall because of the coronavirus, either by choice or not.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Protect Your Family’s Privacy During Remote Learning', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Here to Help; How to Protect Your Family’s Privacy During Remote Learning', 'name': Non