. And he says he had good intentions with his tour that became a coronavirus cluster.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/20/sports/tennis/djokovic-us-open.html', 'snippet': 'He’s monitoring his health closely in the run up to the United States Open. He’s not against all vaccines but wouldn’t want to be forced to take one to play. And he says he had good intentions with his tour that became a coronavirus cluster.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Negotiations and trans-Atlantic flight complete, Novak Djokovic was seated on the sofa of one of his hard-won concessions this week: a spacious rented home near New York City, nestled amid the trees and far from the commotion.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/20/sports/20tennis-djokovic01/merlin_175912935_87fe2c92-9f8f-4660-a3d1-868319d9170a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/20/sports/20tennis-djokovic01/merlin_175912935_87fe2c92-9f8f-4660-a3d1-868319d9170a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/20/sports/20tennis-djokovic01/merlin_175912935_87fe2c92-9f8f-4660-a3d1-868319d9170a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/20/sports/20tennis-djokovic01/merlin_175912935_87fe2c92-9f8f-4660-a3d1-868319d9170a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/20/sports/20tennis-djokovic01/20tennis-djokovic01-thumbSta