virus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gill, Mark', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crowe, Russell', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Unhinged (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Solstice Studios LLC', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-20T19:02:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicole Sperling', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicole', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sperling', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/410d2170-0f08-5768-85eb-d1d1c8a8e8e0', 'word_count': 1030, 'uri': 'nyt://article/410d2170-0f08-5768-85eb-d1d1c8a8e8e0'}, {'abstract': 'I nursed for 2 ½ years, doing what was right for my family and ignoring others’ comments.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/20/parenting/breastfeeding-two-year-old.html', 'snippet': 'I nursed for 2 ½ years, doing what was right for my family and ignoring others’ comments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Breastfeeding is something I always knew I wanted to do when I became a mom. As a Muslim woman, our doctrine tells us that if we are able, breastfeeding for up to two years is beneficial for both the baby and the mother. I wasn’t certain of all the mechanics that came with the act of breastfeeding, or the possibility that sometimes babies may not latch right away and the act could be physically and mentally taxing. However, that set intention turned into a two-and-a-half year commitment that my son and I were fortunate to embark on — together.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subty