 may just be the occasion for Melissa Clark’s latest, lamb chops with lettuce and ranch dressing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A highlight of my week, every week, is the glorious mixed produce box I get from County Line Harvest. I make a run to the farmers’ market for extra bits and bobs when I can, picking up whatever looks good — herbs, flowering greens, plums. But since March, for a million reasons, I’ve been buying and eating way less meat than I used to.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/dining/14apperex/merlin_175275612_c0fbd17c-d7b0-43cd-ab6f-73eb44aab0ea-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/19/dining/14apperex/merlin_175275612_c0fbd17c-d7b0-43cd-ab6f-73eb44aab0ea-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/dining/14apperex/merlin_175275612_c0fbd17c-d7b0-43cd-ab6f-73eb44aab0ea-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/dining/14apperex/merlin_175275612_c0fbd17c-d7b0-43cd-ab6f-73eb44aab0ea-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/19/dining/14apperex/merlin_175275612_c0fbd17c-d7b0-43cd-ab6f-73eb44aab0ea-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/19/dining/14apperex/merlin_175275612_c0fbd17c-d7b0-43cd-ab6f-73eb44aab0ea-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'