 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5bbcd75c-78ad-5344-99f8-4db9d111abd1', 'word_count': 894, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5bbcd75c-78ad-5344-99f8-4db9d111abd1'}, {'abstract': 'Jon Meacham’s remarks at this week’s Democratic National Convention sprang from a long friendship with Joe Biden and a desire to add historical context to the present moment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/21/books/jon-meacham-joe-biden.html', 'snippet': 'Jon Meacham’s remarks at this week’s Democratic National Convention sprang from a long friendship with Joe Biden and a desire to add historical context to the present moment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last month, the historian and biographer Jon Meacham got an unusual request from Joseph R. Biden Jr.’s campaign. The campaign wanted him to speak at the Democratic National Convention — not to endorse Mr. Biden, but to put the stakes of this election in historical context.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/21/books/21Meacham1/merlin_175964370_554c6a92-4fe8-4e90-814e-ed88bd9fbd91-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/21/books/21Meacham1/merlin_175964370_554c6a92-4fe8-4e90-814e-ed88bd9fbd91-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/21/books/21Meacham1/merlin_175964370_554c6a92-4fe8-4e90-814e-ed88bd9fbd91-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/21/books/21Meacham1/merlin_175964370_554c6a92-4fe8-4e90-814e-ed88bd9fbd91-su