ay be realizing he doesn’t have to do it alone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/23/sports/soccer/neymar-psg-.html', 'snippet': 'Paris St.-Germain brought in the Brazilian forward to win games like Sunday’s Champions League final. The key to achieving his goal, and the club’s, may be realizing he doesn’t have to do it alone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Neymar was as good as his word. As he stepped off Paris St.-Germain’s bus a couple of hours before his team’s Champions League quarterfinal against Atalanta, all the pieces were in place. He had his sunglasses perched on his head. He had a speaker blaring “Hoje É Rave,” by the Brazilian D.J.s Bárbara Labres and MC WM. And, as he had promised, he had his hair cut into a mohawk.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/sports/23onsoccer-champions1/23onsoccer-champions1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 340, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/23/sports/23onsoccer-champions1/23onsoccer-champions1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 340}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/sports/23onsoccer-champions1/23onsoccer-champions1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 579, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/sports/23onsoccer-champions1/23onsoccer-champions1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1159, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/sports/23onsoccer-champions1/23onsoccer-champions1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/23/sports/23onsoccer-champions1/23onsoccer-champions1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/sports/23onsoccer-champions1/23onsoccer-champions1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Neymar Finally Grows Up', 'kicker': 'On Soccer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Boy No Longer, Neymar Has P.S.G. Close to Its Goal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'UEFA Champions League (Soccer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Neymar', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Paris St-Germain FC (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-23T04:05:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rory Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rory', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77178ad0-35f2-5c0a-83b4-9e2f4fe18e77', 'word_count': 1590, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77178ad0-35f2-5c0a-83b4-9e2f4fe18e77'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Sunday, Aug. 23, 2020.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/23/pageoneplus/corrections-aug-23-2020.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Sunday, Aug. 23, 2020.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article this weekend on Page 8 about a ballet school in Lagos, Nigeria, misidentifies a ballet school in Birmingham, England. It is the Elmhurst Ballet School of Birmingham Royal Ballet, not of Birmingham Royal Academy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: Aug. 23, 2020', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2020-08-23T04:49:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea4c3b76-7765-50e3-ac8b-a1cce44dcccb', 'word_count': 174, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea4c3b76-7765-50e3-ac8b-a1cce44dcccb'}, {'abstract': 'An HBO documentary series delves into the downfall of Nxivm. And Itsaso Arana stars in a languid summer film set in Madrid.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/23/arts/television/whats-on-tv-sunday-the-vow-and-the-august-virgin.html', 'snippet': 'An HBO documentary series delves into the downfall of Nxivm. And Itsaso Arana stars in a languid summer film set in Madrid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE VOW 10 p.m. on HBO; stream on HBO Max. In 2019, Keith Raniere, the leader of the self-improvement group known as Nxivm, was convicted on charges of racketeering and sex trafficking, his trial exposing the shadowy organization’s inner workings. The group had attracted high-profile members —\xa0including the “Smallville” actress Allison Mack and the heiress Clare Bronfman —\xa0and in 2017, troubling reports of coercion, blackmail and abuse began to surface. This nine-part documentary series examines the disturbing practices that made headlines, but it also delves deeper into the organization to understand why people joined in the first place. Through interviews with former members, the filmmakers Jehane Noujaim and Karim Amer explore the fall of the organization and the emotional toll that it took on those hoping it could help them lead a better life.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/arts/23tvcol-thevow/23tvcol-thevow-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/23/arts/23tvcol-thevow/23tvcol-thevow-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/arts/23tvcol-thevow/23tvcol-thevow-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/arts/23tvcol-thevow/23tvcol-thevow-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1620, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/arts/23tvcol-thevow/23tvcol-thevow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/23/arts/23tvcol-thevow/23tvcol-thevow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/arts/23tvcol-thevow/23tvcol-thevow-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Sunday: ‘The Vow’ and ‘The August Virgin’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Sunday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Progra