fafdc3ce', 'word_count': 828, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5dc20a7f-e86b-5526-9f59-9cdffafdc3ce'}, {'abstract': 'Leonelli Focacceria e Pasticceria is now selling its chocolate chip cookies in a ready-to-bake kit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/24/dining/leonelli-bakery-chocolate-chip-cookies.html', 'snippet': 'Leonelli Focacceria e Pasticceria is now selling its chocolate chip cookies in a ready-to-bake kit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like many restaurateurs and chefs trying to survive the pandemic, Jonathan Benno has gone into the meal kit business. Along with dinner dishes to assemble at home, his Leonelli Focacceria e Pasticceria in the NoMad section of Manhattan is offering frozen chocolate chip cookie dough, ready to bake. Leave space on the baking sheet: The dough makes hefty confections that spread to about four inches in diameter and are thickly peppered with bits of Italian chocolate. You can’t bake just one; the kit comes with a baker’s dozen.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/26/dining/26burner-chip2/26burner-chip2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 513, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/26/dining/26burner-chip2/26burner-chip2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 513}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/26/dining/26burner-chip2/26burner-chip2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 876, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/26/dining/26burner-chip2/26burner-chip2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1751, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': N