arty’s growth — its strength in the suburbs, in rural areas and in races up and down the ballot proving that it could dominate in parts of the country where demographics favored the Democrats. Now it could be a victim of its own excess.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/24/us/elections/this-isnt-the-convention-or-the-election-north-carolina-republicans-had-hoped-for.html', 'snippet': '', 'lead_paragraph': 'For most of the past decade, North Carolina was a showcase for the Republican Party’s growth — its strength in the suburbs, in rural areas and in races up and down the ballot proving that it could dominate in parts of the country where demographics favored the Democrats. Now it could be a victim of its own excess.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/us/politics/24-live-nc/merlin_169921434_bc87ac64-715f-4f09-a351-570c3140be6c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/23/us/politics/24-live-nc/merlin_169921434_bc87ac64-715f-4f09-a351-570c3140be6c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/us/politics/24-live-nc/merlin_169921434_bc87ac64-715f-4f09-a351-570c3140be6c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/us/politics/24-live-nc/merlin_169921434_bc87ac64-715f-4f09-a351-570c3140be6c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/23/us/politics/24-live-nc/23ncgop2-thumbStandard.jpg