e relations and much else. And they painted a dystopian picture of what the nation would look like if Joseph R. Biden Jr. were president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/24/us/politics/republican-convention-recap.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump and his party engaged in sweeping revisionism about his management of the coronavirus, his record on race relations and much else. And they painted a dystopian picture of what the nation would look like if Joseph R. Biden Jr. were ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump and his political allies mounted a fierce and misleading defense of his political record on the first night of the Republican convention on Monday, while unleashing a barrage of attacks on Joseph R. Biden Jr. and the Democratic Party that were unrelenting in their bleakness.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nominating Trump, Republicans Rewrite His Record', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trump Nominated as G.O.P. Delivers Ominous Message', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Republican National Convention', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conservatism (US Politics)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J Jr', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, Timothy Eugene', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haley, Nikki R', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Charlotte (NC)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': '