times.com/2020/08/25/us/politics/black-voters-biden.html', 'snippet': 'For Democrats, who rely on Black voters to power their electoral advantages in America’s urban centers, the difference between good and great Black voter turnout is often a question of Black men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILWAUKEE — Long before the coronavirus pandemic, the economic downturn and the recent protests over racial inequality, the Black men of Milwaukee’s North Side had experience with crises converging all at once.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/us/politics/25blackmen-smith/25blackmen-smith-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/25/us/politics/25blackmen-smith/25blackmen-smith-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/us/politics/25blackmen-smith/25blackmen-smith-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/us/politics/25blackmen-smith/25blackmen-smith-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/us/politics/25blackmen-smith/25blackmen-smith-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/25/us/politics/25blackmen-smith/25blackmen-smith-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/us/politics/25blackmen-smith/25blackmen-smith-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Biden Wants Black Voter Turnout Similar to Obama’s. He’ll Need Black Men.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Biden Seeks High Turnout of Black Men, a Key to Democratic Victories', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Milwaukee (Wis)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wisconsin', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'George Floyd Protests (2020)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black Lives Matter Movement', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-25T09:00:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Astead W. Herndon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Astead', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Herndon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66ec2a1b-7265-5397-bb2c-4ed52735157b', 'word_count': 1732, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66ec2a1b-7265-5397-bb2c-4ed52735157b'}, {'abstract': 'Past Republican leaders knew better than to allow the pathogens of extreme conspiracy theories to infect the political bloodstream.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/25/opinion/trump-qanon-birchers.html', 'snippet': 'Past Republican leaders knew better than to allow the pathogens of extreme conspiracy theories to infect the political bloodstream.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump has flirted with the convoluted QAnon conspiracy theory for months. Last week, he gave a full embrace to its followers, telling reporters that its believers are patriots “who love our country.” Over 70 QAnon supporters have run for Congress as Republicans this year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/opinion/25Kabaservice/25Kabaservice-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/25/opinion/25Kabaservice/25Kabaservice-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/opinion/25Kabaservice/25Kabaservice-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/opinion/25Kabaservice/25Kabaservice-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1389, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/opinion/25Kabaservice/25Kabaservice-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/25/opinion/25Kabaservice/25Ka