es tick and, in her “Passages” books, how adults navigate life’s inevitable changes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/25/books/gail-sheehy-dead.html', 'snippet': 'She looked at what makes public figures tick and, in her “Passages” books, how adults navigate life’s inevitable changes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gail Sheehy, a journalist who plumbed the interior lives of public figures for clues to their behavior, examined societal trends as signposts of cultural shifts and, most famously, illuminated life changes in her book “Passages,” died on Monday at a hospital in Southampton, N.Y. She was 83.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/26/obituaries/25Sheehy1/25Sheehy1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 453, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/26/obituaries/25Sheehy1/25Sheehy1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 453}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/26/obituaries/25Sheehy1/25Sheehy1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 773, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/26/obituaries/25Sheehy1/25Sheehy1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1546, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/26/obituaries/25Sheehy1/25Sheehy1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/26/obituaries/25Sheehy1/25Sheehy1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thu