aylor, mentioned her only in passing during his live speech at the Republican National Convention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/25/us/politics/daniel-cameron-rnc-speech.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Cameron, the first Black attorney general in Kentucky, who is investigating the killing of Breonna Taylor, mentioned her only in passing during his live speech at the Republican National Convention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Attorney General Daniel Cameron of Kentucky has been under intense pressure in recent months to charge three police officers in the killing of Breonna Taylor, who was unarmed when the officers broke into her home without warning and shot her.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Daniel Cameron, Kentucky A.G., Speaks at the R.N.C.: Full Transcript', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cameron, Daniel J (1985- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taylor, Breonna (1993-2020)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-26T03:51:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Maggie Astor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Maggie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Astor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b27e4fa0-17de-5a5f-90a4-dcf2e0ea030a', 'word_count': 1078, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b27e4fa0-17de-5a5f-90a4-dcf2e0ea030a'}, {'abstract': 'The Republicans want white suburban voters to believe that the president is on their side — and that he’s on the side of immigrants and women, too.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/26/us/politics/trump-convention-night-2.html', 'snippet': 'The Republicans want white suburban voters to believe that the president is on their side — and that he’s on the side of immigrants and women, too.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the first night of their convention, Republicans appealed to “quiet neighborhoods” by warning of vengeful mobs of “anarchists.” Twenty-four hours later, Mr. Trump and his party cast the president as the country’s greatest protector — not only from mobs of protesters but also of free speech, economic opportunity and even faith itself.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/us/politics/25repubs-assess1/merlin_176179632_28dc1a65-e293-4146-888d-84ed14d6e39a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/25/us/politics/25repubs-assess1/merlin_176179632_28dc1a65-e293-4146-888d-84ed14d6e39a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/us/politics/25repubs-assess1/merlin_176179632_28dc1a65-e293-4146-888d-84ed14d6e39a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/us/politics/25repubs-assess1/merlin_176179632_28dc1a65-e293-4146-888d-84ed14d6e39a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/25/us/poli