 in quality olive oil become one.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/26/magazine/this-zucchini-tian-is-nonna-inspired-cooking-at-restaurant-speed.html', 'snippet': 'Set in a skillet for efficiency, layers of thinly sliced summer vegetables drenched in quality olive oil become one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was always a little static while trying to bring my lo-fi home cooking into a restaurant setting, producing it at restaurant speed and volume, pace and temperature, and getting it back on the plate in such a way that would still remind you of good home cooking. In spite of its stainless-steel countertops and the crew of line cooks in clogs and aprons and scullery caps cranking out the food each night, Prune was always meant to convey the feeling that there was just some gentle older woman back there in heavy stockings and a cardigan who had fixed you a plate from the pots on the stove.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-eat/30mag-eat-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-eat/30mag-eat-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 451}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-eat/30mag-eat-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 770, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-eat/30mag-eat-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1541, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-eat/30mag-eat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-eat/30mag-eat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-eat/30mag-eat-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'This Zucchini Tian Is Nonna-Inspired Cooking at Restaurant Speed', 'kicker': 'Eat ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nonna-Inspired Cooking', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Zucchini', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-26T09:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gabrielle Hamilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gabrielle', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hamilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e874cb74-8a26-5a5d-9d79-6fc5ebac6e5e', 'word_count': 891, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e874cb74-8a26-5a5d-9d79-6fc5ebac6e5e'}, {'abstract': 'For some of us, shedding the old is less an act of vanity than of self-respect.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/26/magazine/name-change.html', 'snippet': 'For some of us, shedding the old is less an act of vanity than of self-respect.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was 6 when I learned of my father’s death. Before then, I was blithely unaware that fathers existed, having lived only with my mother. But once I started school and saw that other families were different from mine, I went from never noticing fathers to suddenly noticing them everywhere: cheering at softball games; video-recording dance recitals; picking up a friend from school, hoisting her onto his broad shoulders, both of them smiling. I begrudged those daughters for having a male presence in their lives, for having a protector.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-LOR/30mag-LOR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-LOR/30mag-LOR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-LOR/30mag-LOR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-LOR/30mag-LOR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1491, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-LOR/30mag-LOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-LOR/30mag-LOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/30/magazine/30mag-LOR/30mag-LOR-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Changing My Name Allowed Me to Move On', 'kicker': 'Letter of Recommendation', 'conten