ies to customers, he drove an orange cargo van (“a futuristic ice-cream truck”) from Pennsylvania to Vermont, braving storms and downed trees along the way.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/06/books/review/06insidethelist-web/merlin_147472296_a2a6ad32-a65c-44a9-8dfd-4fc58e80f014-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 893, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/09/06/books/review/06insidethelist-web/merlin_147472296_a2a6ad32-a65c-44a9-8dfd-4fc58e80f014-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 893}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/06/books/review/06insidethelist-web/merlin_147472296_a2a6ad32-a65c-44a9-8dfd-4fc58e80f014-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 688, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/06/books/review/06insidethelist-web/merlin_147472296_a2a6ad32-a65c-44a9-8dfd-4fc58e80f014-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1376, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/06/books/review/06insidethelist-web/06insidethelist-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/09/06/books/review/06insidethelist-web/06insidethelist-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/06/books/review/06insidethelist-web/06insidethelist-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbL