'nyt://article/04068157-6651-5702-9224-2eeb69985b48'}, {'abstract': 'The America that many speakers described on Wednesday at the Republican National Convention did not sound like a desirable place: fractious, violent, functionally lawless in some pockets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/27/us/elections/the-gop-argues-that-only-trump-can-stop-the-chaos-but-hes-already-in-charge.html', 'snippet': '', 'lead_paragraph': 'The America that many speakers described on Wednesday at the Republican National Convention did not sound like a desirable place: fractious, violent, functionally lawless in some pockets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The G.O.P. argues that only Trump can stop the chaos. But he’s already in charge.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Republican National Convention', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-27T14:00:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Elections', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Flegenheimer and Katie Glueck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glueck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/043ea22a-59ac-595c-ac90-a97cd612032e', 'word_count': 283, 'uri': 'nyt://article/043ea22a-59ac-595c-ac90-a97cd612032e'}, {'abstract': 'Amid an untamed pandemic that has cost more than 180,000 American lives and millions of jobs, a hurricane battering the Gulf Coast and unrest gripping another city after another police shooting of a Black man, President Trump plans to make his most direct case for re-election yet on Thursday night when he addresses the Republican National Convention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/27/us/elections/at-no-time-before-have-voters-faced-a-clearer-choice-trump-will-say-in-his-convention-address.html', 'snippet': '', 'lead_paragraph': 'Amid an untamed pandemic that has cost more than 180,000 American lives and millions of jobs, a hurricane battering the Gulf Coast and unrest gripping another city after another police shooting of a Black man, President Trump plans to make his most direct case for re-election yet on Thursday night when he addresses the Republican National Convention.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/27/us/politics/27live-trumprelect/merlin_176230137_1276dc8b-08c3-47b6-a836-118d98d5ee4c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/27/us/politics/27live-trumprelect/merlin_176230137_1276dc8b-08c3-47b6-a836-118d98d5ee4c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/27/us/politics/27live-trumprelect/merlin_176230137_1276dc8b-08c3-47b6-a836-118d98d5ee4c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/27/us/politics/27live-trumprelect/merlin_176230137_1276dc8b-08c3-47b6-a836-118d98d5ee4c-superJumbo.jp