: 'nyt://article/f4de8f96-3195-5883-b666-73e5ef5274e3'}, {'abstract': 'He said Russia had formed a security force that could intervene if its neighbor “gets out of control.” But for Mr. Putin, that poses the risk creating another anti-Russian hotbed like Ukraine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/27/world/europe/belarus-russia-putin.html', 'snippet': 'He said Russia had formed a security force that could intervene if its neighbor “gets out of control.” But for Mr. Putin, that poses the risk creating another anti-Russian hotbed like Ukraine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — President Vladimir V. Putin of Russia gave an ominous warning on Thursday to protesters in Belarus not to push too hard to topple their country’s embattled president, saying that Russia had formed a special reserve force of security officers to restore order in the event of chaos in its western neighbor.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/27/world/27belarus-putin-sub/merlin_176160786_362547c8-c244-4ecd-9746-db7b0bbc4f69-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/27/world/27belarus-putin-sub/merlin_176160786_362547c8-c244-4ecd-9746-db7b0bbc4f69-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/27/world/27belarus-putin-sub/merlin_176160786_362547c8-c244-4ecd-9746-db7b0bbc4f69-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/27/world/27belarus-putin-sub/merlin_176160786_362547c8-c244-4ecd-9746-db7b0bbc4f69-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJ