 substances, often affecting poorer or minority communities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/27/climate/hurricane-laura-fire-pollution.html', 'snippet': 'Hurricane Laura rolled over a coast studded with refineries and chemical plants. Other storms have caused the release of toxic substances, often affecting poorer or minority communities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A fire blazed, and acrid smoke poured from a Louisiana chemical factory, confirming fears that Hurricane Laura’s ravaging winds and water would release toxic pollution in a region central to the petrochemical industry that is increasingly exposed to major storms. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When Hurricanes Lead to Industrial Fires, Minority Neighborhoods Can Take a Hit', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fire Breaks Out at Chemical Plant, Endangering a Black Community', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hazardous and Toxic Substances', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Laura (2020)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricanes and Tropical Storms', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sasol Ltd', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Port Arthur (Tex)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Louisiana', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-27T21:06:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Climate', 'section_name': 'Climat