therapy, and for the therapist, who could listen to stories of childhood abuse and gently unwind their hold on the present. Those regular office sessions, at a clinic at the University of California, Davis, created a strong bond, and Mr. Raymos came to rely on them to manage symptoms of post-traumatic stress and the emotional weight of a neurodegenerative disorder that struck him in 2012, in the prime of adulthood.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/01/science/31VIRUS-TELETHERAPY/merlin_172099596_7677620a-7d3e-4ce0-8fb1-7887d6f10a80-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/09/01/science/31VIRUS-TELETHERAPY/merlin_172099596_7677620a-7d3e-4ce0-8fb1-7887d6f10a80-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/01/science/31VIRUS-TELETHERAPY/merlin_172099596_7677620a-7d3e-4ce0-8fb1-7887d6f10a80-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/01/science/31VIRUS-TELETHERAPY/merlin_172099596_7677620a-7d3e-4ce0-8fb1-7887d6f10a80-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/01/science/31VIRUS-TELETHERAPY/31VIRUS-TELETHERAPY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/09/01/science/31VIRUS-TELETHERAPY/31VIRUS-TELETHERAPY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 