ea-537f-9c7d-d67fa33024ff', 'word_count': 389, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ae1b393-40ea-537f-9c7d-d67fa33024ff'}, {'abstract': 'The agency’s chief spokeswoman, Emily Miller, was removed from her position just 11 days into the job. And the contract was terminated of a consultant who had advised the F.D.A. chief to correct misleading claims about plasma’s benefits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/28/health/blood-plasma-fda.html', 'snippet': 'The agency’s chief spokeswoman, Emily Miller, was removed from her position just 11 days into the job. And the contract was terminated of a consultant who had advised the F.D.A. chief to correct misleading claims about plasma’s benefits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The head of the Food and Drug Administration ousted its top spokeswoman from her position on Friday in an urgent bid to restore the tarnished credibility of the agency after he made erroneous claims that overstated the benefits of plasma treatments for Covid-19 at a news conference with President Trump.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/28/science/28VIRUS-FDA1/merlin_176090151_073f11ec-f84f-4d4c-9a61-21f8383f0303-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/28/science/28VIRUS-FDA1/merlin_176090151_073f11ec-f84f-4d4c-9a61-21f8383f0303-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/28/science/28VIRUS-FDA1/merlin_176090151_073f11ec-f84f-4d4c-9a61-21f8383f0303-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/28/science/28VIRUS-FDA1/merlin_176090151_0