ways took their time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a perilous westerly course bound for Cape Horn near the southern tip of South America in 2002, Larry and Lin Pardey made their approach into the hazardous currents of the Strait of Le Maire aboard Taleisin, their 29-foot, engineless wooden yacht.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/31/obituaries/Pardey1/merlin_176240115_64e693b7-3b12-4524-86af-eb7ba9a8c23a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 884, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/31/obituaries/Pardey1/merlin_176240115_64e693b7-3b12-4524-86af-eb7ba9a8c23a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 884}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/31/obituaries/Pardey1/merlin_176240115_64e693b7-3b12-4524-86af-eb7ba9a8c23a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 695, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/31/obituaries/Pardey1/merlin_176240115_64e693b7-3b12-4524-86af-eb7ba9a8c23a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 1357, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/31/obituaries/Pardey1/merlin_176240115_64e693b7-3b12-4524-86af-eb7ba9a8c23a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/31/obituaries/Pardey1/merlin_176240115_64e693b7-3b12-4524-86af-eb7ba9a8c23a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/3