 since March, but the willingness of people to sit inside a closed room with strangers for several hours is still uncertain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/28/business/media/coronavirus-movie-theaters-new-mutants.html', 'snippet': 'Big-budget films are being released for the first time since March, but the willingness of people to sit inside a closed room with strangers for several hours is still uncertain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HENDERSON, Nev. — The Regal Sunset Station multiplex in suburban Las Vegas reopened on Thursday night after sitting empty for five months in eerie pandemic-forced exile. One of the first people to take a center seat, popcorn and orange soda in hand, was Brian Truitt, who bought tickets to “The New Mutants,” a Marvel superhero movie, a week in advance.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/29/business/29virus-movietheaters-1/merlin_176273355_e94afe86-3c98-48e7-b5de-a8a130d76aff-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/29/business/29virus-movietheaters-1/merlin_176273355_e94afe86-3c98-48e7-b5de-a8a130d76aff-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/29/business/29virus-movietheaters-1/merlin_176273355_e94afe86-3c98-48e7-b5de-a8a130d76aff-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/29/business/29virus-movietheaters-1/merlin_176273355_e94afe86-3c98-48e7-b5de-a8a130d76aff-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt