'word_count': 1127, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6f4b2919-3302-5edb-9ff4-9937da0dab09'}, {'abstract': 'At the Republican National Convention, the president and two other New Yorkers painted a dark picture of the city. The reality is more complex.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/28/nyregion/trump-rnc-urban-crime.html', 'snippet': 'At the Republican National Convention, the president and two other New Yorkers painted a dark picture of the city. The reality is more complex.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When President Trump sought to paint an apocalyptic portrait of big-city crime as out of control at the Republican National Convention Thursday night, he turned to two fellow New Yorkers to help him make the case.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/28/nyregion/28nycrime/28nycrime-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/28/nyregion/28nycrime/28nycrime-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/28/nyregion/28nycrime/28nycrime-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/28/nyregion/28nycrime/28nycrime-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/28/nyregion/28nycrime/28nycrime-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/28/nyregion/28nycrime/28nycrime-thumbStandard.jpg