 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa23b3da-781f-5c81-9099-0b29ef09c014'}, {'abstract': 'The Trump team’s approach to the task of pigeonholing the challenger looked less focused than those used in 2004 and 2012.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/28/upshot/republican-convention-trump-strategy.html', 'snippet': 'The Trump team’s approach to the task of pigeonholing the challenger looked less focused than those used in 2004 and 2012.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last two presidential re-election campaigns followed a similar playbook: define the opposition early on the most important issue, emphasize a few cultural wedge issues to rally the base while appealing to a few swing voters, and reinvigorate supporters at the convention. It was enough for George W. Bush in 2004 and Barack Obama in 2012 to flip their approval ratings from negative to positive, and to win re-election.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/28/upshot/28up-polls-conventions/merlin_176289099_2d4de61e-464c-4dba-81ad-18688c12d3d7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/28/upshot/28up-polls-conventions/merlin_176289099_2d4de61e-464c-4dba-81ad-18688c12d3d7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/28/upshot/28up-polls-conventions/merlin_176289099_2d4de61e-464c-4dba-81ad-18688c12d3d7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/28/upshot/28up-polls-conventions/merlin_176289099_2d4de61e-464c-4dba-81ad-18688c12d3d7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'supe