ect', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Collegiate Athletic Assn', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantines', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Big 12 Conference', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Big Ten Conference', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlantic Coast Conference', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pacific-12 Conference', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Southeastern Conference', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-08-29T18:30:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/3059daa1-d2ea-5af8-9b1e-5212f6db406c', 'word_count': 1379, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3059daa1-d2ea-5af8-9b1e-5212f6db406c'}, {'abstract': 'Threatening to turn families out of their homes during the coronavirus fight isn’t just morally suspect; it’s dangerous.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/29/opinion/sunday/coronavirus-evictions-superspreader.html', 'snippet': 'Threatening to turn families out of their homes during the coronavirus fight isn’t just morally suspect; it’s dangerous.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A year and a half ago, Jhon Loaiza and his wife, Sugey Bedoya, moved with their three daughters — now 12, 5 and 3 — from a two-bedroom apartment in New York City to a compact brick ranch house in San Antonio. They loved that house — its fenced-in backyard and four whole bedrooms, each with soft tan carpet — and their new city. They would 