ttlement.html', 'snippet': 'The settlement, which is for more than $470,000, comes after an episode last year in which officers responded to a shoplifting complaint at a Family Dollar store.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The city of Phoenix has reached a settlement with a Black family for more than $470,000 after a widely viewed video last year showed police officers drawing their weapons and shouting expletives at the family while responding to a shoplifting complaint.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/29/multimedia/29xp-phoenix-settlement-pix/merlin_166360821_5aa93029-003b-42b5-9893-1abb119d9994-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/08/29/multimedia/29xp-phoenix-settlement-pix/merlin_166360821_5aa93029-003b-42b5-9893-1abb119d9994-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/29/multimedia/29xp-phoenix-settlement-pix/merlin_166360821_5aa93029-003b-42b5-9893-1abb119d9994-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 657, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/29/multimedia/29xp-phoenix-settlement-pix/merlin_166360821_5aa93029-003b-42b5-9893-1abb119d9994-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1313, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/08/29/multimedia/29xp-phoenix-settlement-pix/29xp-phoenix-settlement-pix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/08/29/mult