 to live in that kind of environment,” she said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/30/world/africa/jeanette-carlson-dead.html', 'snippet': 'She was deported from South Africa in 1971 for her activity and vowed never to return. “It was disgusting to live in that kind of environment,” she said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jeanette Carlson, an anti-apartheid activist who with her husband fought against the racist South African government, and who with her family was eventually deported, died on Aug. 18 at her home in Silver Spring, Md. She was 91. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/02/obituaries/28Carlson1/merlin_176282205_7d78077d-ebda-45a2-87f5-79bc27111a6a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/09/02/obituaries/28Carlson1/merlin_176282205_7d78077d-ebda-45a2-87f5-79bc27111a6a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 710}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/02/obituaries/28Carlson1/merlin_176282205_7d78077d-ebda-45a2-87f5-79bc27111a6a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 865, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/02/obituaries/28Carlson1/merlin_176282205_7d78077d-ebda-45a2-87f5-79bc27111a6a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1730, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/09/02/obituaries/28Carlson1/28Carlson1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/09/02/obituaries/28Ca